<title>FRANCE: Suez net asset sales totals 1.7 bln Ffr. [CORRECTED 08:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>Suez net asset sales totals 1.7 bln Ffr. [CORRECTED 08:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie de Suez said on Wednesday that in the first half of 1996 asset sales and reimbursements totalled 1.7 billion francs. (Corrects to make clear the 1.7 billion franc figure is the total and not the capital gain)</p>
<p>The company also said its net real estate exposure fell to 12.4 billion francs compared with 14.1 billion francs. Suez said it provisioned its exposure at a rate of 55 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
